    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/bc51544b093a989d87ae71f19b91ae75.avif?t=1752370965\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLYGLOCK</strong>\u00a0combines flash-card style prompts with FPS aiming mechanics to offer extremely satisfying, fun and productive gameplay. Experience incredible progress and form highly durable memories by using both motor and cognitive pathways while you are playing.<br><br>Create and share your own customized flash-card lists to learn anything you like, or dive into the official Japanese Module, complete with curated content and pronunciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=798 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Perfect for total beginners to advanced players. You can learn at your own pace with helpful hints that come complete with  voiceover pronunciations. For the daring, there are modes to remove English and Furigana guides to truly test your Kanji skills.    <br>  <br>You can choose from as little or as much material to learn from as you like. From the base vowels (\u3042/a,\u00a0\u3044/i,\u00a0\u3046/u,\u00a0\u3048/e,\u00a0\u304a/o) all the way to 1500+ vocabulary with advanced Kanji.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Flex both your knowledge and aiming skills by chasing highscores that show off how many correct answers you entered within the time limit. Each unique combination of learning material selected for the run will have it's own highscore. You can also test and refine your mouse sensitivity easily with a cm/360 calculator in the options. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=798 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/bc51544b093a989d87ae71f19b91ae75.avif?t=1752370965\" data-has-big width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLYGLOCK</strong>\u00a0combines flash-card style prompts with FPS aiming mechanics to offer extremely satisfying, fun and productive gameplay. Experience incredible progress and form highly durable memories by using both motor and cognitive pathways while you are playing.<br><br>Create and share your own customized flash-card lists to learn anything you like, or dive into the official Japanese Module, complete with curated content and pronunciations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=798 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/b92b411e2ac614815d80050d913839f7.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=800 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/af123716b0bb27b63186a872f1d59ddb.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Perfect for total beginners to advanced players. You can learn at your own pace with helpful hints that come complete with  voiceover pronunciations. For the daring, there are modes to remove English and Furigana guides to truly test your Kanji skills.    <br>  <br>You can choose from as little or as much material to learn from as you like. From the base vowels (\u3042/a,\u00a0\u3044/i,\u00a0\u3046/u,\u00a0\u3048/e,\u00a0\u304a/o) all the way to 1500+ vocabulary with advanced Kanji.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=600 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/9bda55059d88248895d3738d5c579c4a.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Flex both your knowledge and aiming skills by chasing highscores that show off how many correct answers you entered within the time limit. Each unique combination of learning material selected for the run will have it's own highscore. You can also test and refine your mouse sensitivity easily with a cm/360 calculator in the options. <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.poster.avif?t=1752370965\" width=798 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.webm?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522530/extras/ff6c50d71c4b32ad1a74dfa60f064eee.mp4?t=1752370965\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
